  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Energieffekt gruvindustri</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy saving industries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ra kunskap om moderna energisparteknologi till de st&#xf6;rsta industriella energikonsumenterna i regionen. Projektet best&#xe5;r av seminarier och f&#xf6;rberedelsearbete. Sju stora f&#xf6;retag i Murmansk regioner &#xe4;r involverade i projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at transfer of know-how in the field of modern energysaving technologies in heavy industries. The project consists of seminars and preparatory work. Seven major companies in the Murmansk region are involved in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
